1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:01,740
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,380
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,080
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:07,950
(Episode 58)

5
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:29,300
(DNA Test Result)

6
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,780
(Ko Eun Seol and Joo Mi Ran
aren't biologically related.)

7
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,050
What the...

8
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:50,890
Darn it!

9
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:16,510
You only found out recently
I was your daughter?

10
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:17,750
I swear it's true.

11
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:20,720
I had no idea you were still alive.

12
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:23,920
Your mom told me you died long ago.

13
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:28,430
I've never forgotten you
or your mom...

14
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:31,400
for a single moment.

15
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,200
Then...

16
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,310
that means the real daughter
is out there somewhere.

17
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:44,980
The real daughter of Cheongma Group.

18
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,680
That's right. Yes.

19
00:01:48,110 --> 00:01:49,410
She must be out there somewhere.

20
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:51,320
Or maybe...

21
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,190
she died a long time ago.

22
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,560
Listen to me very carefully.

23
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,560
The moment...

24
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:08,600
anyone finds out my parents
are you and Director Joo,

25
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,840
I mean, Joo Ae Sook,

26
00:02:14,370 --> 00:02:15,910
I swear I'll bite my tongue and die.

27
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,440
If you don't want to see me dead,

28
00:02:20,610 --> 00:02:22,050
keep your mouth shut.

29
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,920
Also,

30
00:02:27,390 --> 00:02:28,850
you have a job to do.

31
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:30,260
What is it?

32
00:02:31,390 --> 00:02:34,030
I told you, I'll do anything
for my daughter.

33
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,290
Find the girl
who was switched with me.

34
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Find her...

35
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,900
and bring her to me.

36
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:45,340
And then what?

37
00:02:46,370 --> 00:02:49,970
I'll take care of the rest,
so stay out of it.

38
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:55,780
Got it, my daughter.

39
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,350
Just trust your dad.

40
00:03:32,820 --> 00:03:36,320
An Guk Cheol, that scumbag
actually tracked down my daughter?

41
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:40,120
I should've finished him off
with my own hands back then.

42
00:03:41,730 --> 00:03:43,660
How do I get rid of this guy?

43
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,760
Are you my mom or something?

44
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:51,070
Unless you're my mom,
mind your own business.

45
00:03:56,670 --> 00:03:58,440
Right, you're back.

46
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:00,880
I did some digging,

47
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,180
and it appears An Guk Cheol is
still in Seoul.

48
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:05,020
What?

49
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:06,320
There have been
a few sightings of him...

50
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:08,550
hanging around
the wealthy residential areas...

51
00:04:08,550 --> 00:04:09,550
in Seoul.

52
00:04:09,790 --> 00:04:11,920
- Wealthy residential areas?
- Yes.

53
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:14,930
So I'm thinking of placing
some people in the area.

54
00:04:14,930 --> 00:04:15,990
No.

55
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:20,770
If he keeps digging
into An Guk Cheol,

56
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:23,200
he'll find out An Guk Cheol
contacted Hae Ra,

57
00:04:23,770 --> 00:04:26,940
and then he'll figure out
our relationship.

58
00:04:28,670 --> 00:04:29,770
Let's just...

59
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:32,180
wrap up this matter
with An Guk Cheol here.

60
00:04:33,110 --> 00:04:34,110
Pardon?

61
00:04:34,610 --> 00:04:36,480
From the way he's acting,

62
00:04:36,550 --> 00:04:39,520
it looks like he's planning
something else unrelated to us.

63
00:04:39,620 --> 00:04:42,690
Getting mixed up with him
will only give us more to lose.

64
00:04:42,690 --> 00:04:44,720
But if we just leave him be...

65
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:46,720
He won't be able to make
any reckless moves anyway.

66
00:04:46,790 --> 00:04:50,190
He won't dare come near us
out of fear that we might catch him.

67
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:53,770
Secretary Choi, for the time being,
focus only on company affairs.

68
00:04:54,030 --> 00:04:55,600
Do you understand me?

69
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:57,540
Yes, I understand.

70
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,370
Good. You may go.

71
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,790
Are we really wrapping up...

72
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,090
An Guk Cheol like this?

73
00:06:54,850 --> 00:06:55,950
Joo Mi Ran.

74
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:59,320
I'm done dancing to your tune.

75
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:01,860
Now it's my turn.

76
00:07:08,300 --> 00:07:11,370
Ko Eun Guk, come get your laundry.

77
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,140
Eun Seol!

78
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:22,650
What on earth did you do
to your hair?

79
00:07:24,180 --> 00:07:25,550
Well...

80
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:28,520
My hair felt a bit heavy.

81
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,550
Still...

82
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:30,860
Did you cut it yourself?

83
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,390
I'll go to a salon tomorrow
to clean it up.

84
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:37,200
Eun Seol, were you
secretly dating someone...

85
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,330
and then got dumped?

86
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:41,400
- No.
- Come on, if that isn't it,

87
00:07:41,470 --> 00:07:43,100
why did you suddenly
chop your hair off?

88
00:07:44,170 --> 00:07:46,740
I just wanted to clear my head.

89
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:49,470
I felt like I'd been spacing out
for too long.

90
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:56,050
Wait, in this house,

91
00:07:56,050 --> 00:07:58,850
isn't she the only one who
actually has her head on straight?

92
00:07:58,850 --> 00:07:59,920
Exactly!

93
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:02,190
You two are the ones
drifting through life.

94
00:08:03,190 --> 00:08:05,920
Why don't you two shave your heads
completely bald?

95
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:07,120
Who knows?

96
00:08:07,490 --> 00:08:08,760
It might knock some sense into you.

97
00:08:09,030 --> 00:08:10,190
Then let's shave them together.

98
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:13,030
If you ask me,
you're the one who needs it most.

99
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,900
Fine, you brat.

100
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:18,000
Go ahead and turn your old mother
into a Buddhist nun.

101
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,500
I think something's up with her.

102
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:22,510
Then look into it.

103
00:08:22,510 --> 00:08:25,740
Quit hovering over
Teun Teun's mom all day...

104
00:08:25,810 --> 00:08:27,850
and look after your sister for once.

105
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:32,220
Got it.

106
00:08:40,060 --> 00:08:42,090
It's not like
I didn't notice at all.

107
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:44,430
After Attorney Seo died,

108
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,400
I saw glimpses
of Director Joo's true nature.

109
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,470
Maybe I was the one
who turned a blind eye.

110
00:08:53,570 --> 00:08:57,140
So desperate for a mother's love,
I almost became her puppet.

111
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,320
Following Manager Na's trail...

112
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:16,390
must've led Attorney Seo
straight to Director Joo.

113
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:18,260
Along the way,

114
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,730
he must have discovered
she's my birth mother.

115
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:24,940
That's probably why
he couldn't tell me everything.

116
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:29,740
Realizing this, Director Joo
must have felt cornered,

117
00:09:30,340 --> 00:09:31,910
which is why Attorney Seo...

118
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:41,020
She even went as far as pretending
to be my real mom.

119
00:09:42,150 --> 00:09:44,390
What on earth is she trying to hide?

120
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:07,010
Eun Seol, did you cut your hair?

121
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:08,910
Yes.

122
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:11,520
Isn't it a little too short?

123
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,990
I was just tired of it.

124
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:17,790
- Does it suit me?
- Yes, it suits you.

125
00:10:17,860 --> 00:10:20,190
It feels pretty dramatic and bold.

126
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,630
I heard a lot of women are catching
the short-hair bug lately.

127
00:10:22,690 --> 00:10:24,200
I guess you caught it too.

128
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,470
Ko Eun Seol, what gives?

129
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:36,910
What do you mean?

130
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,780
What's with the hair?

131
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,380
Is this because of our engagement?

132
00:10:45,180 --> 00:10:46,680
So pathetic.

133
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:03,530
Eun Seol, want some tea?

134
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:09,770
You cut your hair, Eun Seol.

135
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:13,410
- Yes.
- It suits you. It's pretty.

136
00:11:14,110 --> 00:11:15,850
- Really?
- Yes.

137
00:11:16,350 --> 00:11:19,020
What made you cut it
all of a sudden?

138
00:11:19,520 --> 00:11:20,990
I wanted to look like you, Mom.

139
00:11:21,650 --> 00:11:22,650
Like me?

140
00:11:23,050 --> 00:11:26,120
When it's just the two of us,
can I call you Mom?

141
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,560
Well...

142
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:29,160
Of course you can.

143
00:11:30,060 --> 00:11:31,700
I'm the one who's grateful.

144
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:34,070
After I cut it,

145
00:11:34,130 --> 00:11:36,530
everyone said
I look just like you, Mom.

146
00:11:37,370 --> 00:11:38,700
It caught me a bit off guard.

147
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:41,540
You're my daughter.
Of course you look like me.

148
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:45,040
Still,
is there really no other reason?

149
00:11:45,610 --> 00:11:47,910
A woman doesn't cut her hair short
for no reason.

150
00:11:48,110 --> 00:11:49,480
There's no other reason.

151
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:51,920
I was reborn.

152
00:11:54,190 --> 00:11:56,490
Being reborn as your daughter,

153
00:11:56,590 --> 00:11:58,990
I thought I needed
at least this much of a change.

154
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,130
I see.

155
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:05,400
Yes, with your hair short,
you really do look more like me.

156
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:07,470
I know.

157
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:09,100
Drink your tea before it gets cold.

158
00:12:21,710 --> 00:12:23,280
What's weighing on you so heavily?

159
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:25,050
Is there something on your mind?

160
00:12:26,450 --> 00:12:28,050
Actually, it's not about me.

161
00:12:30,250 --> 00:12:32,190
Eun Seol's been
acting strange lately.

162
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:33,720
Eun Seol?

163
00:12:34,130 --> 00:12:35,160
A few days ago,

164
00:12:35,190 --> 00:12:37,530
she just went and chopped off
all of her hair by herself.

165
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,430
How much did she cut off?

166
00:12:40,260 --> 00:12:42,000
Up to about here.

167
00:12:43,130 --> 00:12:44,440
That much?

168
00:12:45,070 --> 00:12:46,070
Yes.

169
00:12:46,370 --> 00:12:49,640
She's never had short hair
in her entire life.

170
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:52,240
It's always been long and straight.

171
00:12:55,310 --> 00:12:57,720
Being a woman yourself,
you might have an idea.

172
00:12:58,150 --> 00:13:01,450
Would a woman cut her hair like that
without a reason?

173
00:13:02,390 --> 00:13:03,920
Not usually.

174
00:13:04,420 --> 00:13:07,590
Most of the time
it's after a breakup,

175
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,090
or if not...

176
00:13:10,060 --> 00:13:13,030
It's when we're craving a change
or looking for a fresh start.

177
00:13:15,430 --> 00:13:17,540
She's been having
a hard time lately.

178
00:13:18,170 --> 00:13:19,840
There's what happened
with Attorney Seo,

179
00:13:20,370 --> 00:13:22,270
and on top of that,
she felt guilty around you.

180
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:26,440
Yet just a few days ago,

181
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:29,410
she was even talking about
moving out on her own.

182
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:31,120
Eun Seol said that?

183
00:13:31,380 --> 00:13:32,380
Yes.

184
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:36,620
Should I go talk to her?

185
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:39,790
- You?
- Yes.

186
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:43,060
She might find it easier
to open up to me...

187
00:13:43,690 --> 00:13:45,160
since we're both women.

188
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:49,300
I'd really appreciate that.

189
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:51,900
But are you sure it's okay?

190
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,240
Of course.

191
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:56,870
My brother used to do this
all the time.

192
00:13:58,180 --> 00:14:00,040
Now I want to be there for Eun Seol.

193
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:08,020
Thank you so much.

194
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,100
You changed your hair.

195
00:14:21,830 --> 00:14:22,870
Yes.

196
00:14:24,370 --> 00:14:26,770
Did something bring on
this sudden change?

197
00:14:28,370 --> 00:14:31,040
I just don't want to lose
anyone else I care about.

198
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:36,110
I feel like I've been living
in a daze...

199
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:38,780
and letting the important things
slip right past me.

200
00:14:41,190 --> 00:14:43,020
I want to get my act together now.

201
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,060
Did something happen?

202
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:50,030
Yes.

203
00:14:50,790 --> 00:14:53,400
But I don't think
it was necessarily a bad thing.

204
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:55,000
You don't need to worry.

205
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:59,700
All right, that's a relief.

206
00:15:00,070 --> 00:15:03,570
Right. I'll revise the proposal
and report back to you.

207
00:15:03,610 --> 00:15:04,610
Okay.

208
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:23,160
Hae Ra, want to grab lunch today?

209
00:15:23,660 --> 00:15:25,330
You don't want to study abroad?

210
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:29,470
Why? Do you feel like
you're burdening me?

211
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:33,000
Not at all.
The offer is from my own mom,

212
00:15:33,070 --> 00:15:35,040
so why would I feel burdened?
I'm grateful.

213
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:36,840
Then why?

214
00:15:37,340 --> 00:15:40,740
I just want to spend
more time with you.

215
00:15:41,550 --> 00:15:43,610
- What?
- I want to stay by your side,

216
00:15:43,610 --> 00:15:44,920
help you with your work,

217
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:46,450
and learn the ropes.

218
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:49,190
Still, you're a designer.

219
00:15:49,790 --> 00:15:53,360
Studying overseas would benefit you
so much more.

220
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:56,990
We spent all that time apart.

221
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:00,730
It feels like
such a waste of the time...

222
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:03,270
we could have shared.

223
00:16:04,370 --> 00:16:08,310
From now on,
I want to stick right by your side.

224
00:16:09,810 --> 00:16:12,240
I see. So that's why.

225
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,040
Can I do that?

226
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:15,810
Of course.

227
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:19,120
I want us to be together
for a long time, too.

228
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,690
Thank you for understanding.

229
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:30,990
You seem to have a lot
on your mind lately.

230
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:32,530
Is something wrong?

231
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:34,800
What?

232
00:16:36,070 --> 00:16:37,270
No, it's nothing.

233
00:16:37,530 --> 00:16:38,600
Kang Hae Ra.

234
00:16:39,570 --> 00:16:40,740
Be honest with me.

235
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:44,380
Shouldn't you be able
to confide in me?

236
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:46,740
That way, I can at least help.

237
00:16:47,850 --> 00:16:49,150
If I told you,

238
00:16:50,310 --> 00:16:51,350
would you really...

239
00:16:51,950 --> 00:16:53,820
be able to do anything about it?

240
00:16:54,850 --> 00:16:55,920
Yes.

241
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:58,460
That's why we got engaged, isn't it?

242
00:16:58,790 --> 00:17:00,490
It wasn't for me at all.

243
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:04,900
You got engaged
to save yourself, Seok Jin.

244
00:17:06,330 --> 00:17:08,100
I don't think that was for me.

245
00:17:10,370 --> 00:17:11,570
Kang Hae Ra.

246
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:15,370
Forget it. Let's just go eat.

247
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:27,750
I can't check who else was born
at the hospital that day.

248
00:17:28,050 --> 00:17:31,620
They refuse to share
private information.

249
00:17:32,190 --> 00:17:34,760
Still, you have to find out
no matter what.

250
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:37,090
Why go the hard way?

251
00:17:37,090 --> 00:17:38,900
The person who switched you...

252
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,730
is right next to you.

253
00:17:42,430 --> 00:17:45,070
Ask your mom,
and you'll find out right away.

254
00:17:45,370 --> 00:17:48,770
The one who switched the babies
would know.

255
00:17:49,470 --> 00:17:51,880
No. That woman must never find out.

256
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:53,880
I have to continue to be...

257
00:17:54,310 --> 00:17:56,450
Kang Young Hoon
and Kim Jung Sun's daughter.

258
00:17:57,050 --> 00:18:00,480
My dear daughter,
think a little further ahead.

259
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:04,320
You are our daughter,
and at the same time,

260
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:07,790
you will become
the successor of Cheongma.

261
00:18:08,390 --> 00:18:10,460
Your mom set this whole thing up...

262
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:14,260
as part of her grand scheme.

263
00:18:14,670 --> 00:18:17,400
Now your mom, you, and I...

264
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:19,640
The three of us...

265
00:18:20,870 --> 00:18:22,710
are practically in the same boat.

266
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:40,890
You only found out recently
I was your daughter?

267
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,390
I swear it's true.

268
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:45,430
I had no idea you were still alive.

269
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:48,630
Your mom told me you died long ago.

270
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,830
So she knows she's my daughter...

271
00:18:51,970 --> 00:18:53,600
and she's been avoiding me
even more?

272
00:18:57,110 --> 00:18:59,840
That's my daughter, all right.

273
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:01,980
That's right.

274
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:04,010
Kang Hae Ra,

275
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,220
don't give up.

276
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:09,350
I will protect you...

277
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:13,320
until the day
Cheongma becomes yours.

278
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:17,360
(Cheongma)

279
00:19:17,530 --> 00:19:18,530
Yes?

280
00:19:20,530 --> 00:19:22,770
Hey, Eun Seol.

281
00:19:24,170 --> 00:19:25,470
Do you have a moment?

282
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:28,470
Yes, of course. In fact,
I was just about to call you.

283
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:32,010
Really?
I guess we're completely in sync.

284
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:34,810
So, is there something
you want to talk about?

285
00:19:35,410 --> 00:19:37,150
Well, it's just that...

286
00:19:37,710 --> 00:19:40,020
I'd like to attend an academy.

287
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:41,520
An academy?

288
00:19:41,590 --> 00:19:44,560
Yes. Studying abroad right away
seems difficult,

289
00:19:44,590 --> 00:19:46,460
so I was thinking of enrolling
in a language school.

290
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:48,060
What do you think, Mom?

291
00:19:48,260 --> 00:19:49,490
A language school?

292
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:52,130
Well, that's not a bad idea.

293
00:19:52,730 --> 00:19:53,860
Thank you.

294
00:20:02,410 --> 00:20:04,780
Here, use this
to register for classes.

295
00:20:05,110 --> 00:20:07,580
Thank you, Mom.
I could've paid for it myself.

296
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:11,420
And buy whatever else you need.

297
00:20:11,420 --> 00:20:13,220
That card is for your personal use.

298
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:17,620
Am I really getting
my very own Mom's credit card?

299
00:20:18,420 --> 00:20:19,890
Is that so? I guess you are.

300
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:23,460
Thank you, Mom.
I'll put it to good use.

301
00:20:23,990 --> 00:20:25,100
All right.

302
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:28,200
And as for the language school,
I'll put in a word in advance.

303
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,970
These days,
even a basic consultation...

304
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,500
requires booking ahead.

305
00:20:32,970 --> 00:20:35,010
Okay, please do that for me.

306
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:47,950
Can I get this exact same model?

307
00:20:49,420 --> 00:20:50,490
This was...

308
00:20:50,890 --> 00:20:53,820
only offered to 100 VIPs
5 years ago,

309
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:55,660
so it isn't available
for purchase, ma'am.

310
00:20:55,990 --> 00:20:58,860
Then is there anything similar?

311
00:21:02,530 --> 00:21:05,440
If Director Joo is really behind
Attorney Seo's death,

312
00:21:06,270 --> 00:21:08,540
she'll definitely show up
at the scene again.

313
00:21:09,910 --> 00:21:12,040
If I set a trap beforehand...

314
00:21:23,090 --> 00:21:25,890
I should use this
to rattle Director Joo first.

315
00:21:34,970 --> 00:21:36,070
Eun Seol.

316
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:37,630
Hello, ma'am.

317
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:41,710
It's you, right?
I see you cut your hair.

318
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:44,070
It looks lovely.

319
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,980
Would you like to have tea with me?

320
00:21:47,610 --> 00:21:48,680
I'd love to.

321
00:21:48,850 --> 00:21:51,680
What made you cut it so short?

322
00:21:51,780 --> 00:21:56,390
Weren't you sad to cut it off?
Still, it really suits you.

323
00:21:57,450 --> 00:21:58,690
Thank you.

324
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:00,890
You look much more lively,

325
00:22:01,320 --> 00:22:03,460
and even younger, too.

326
00:22:05,860 --> 00:22:08,300
You know, with hair cut that short,

327
00:22:08,700 --> 00:22:12,500
you kind of look like me
when I was young.

328
00:22:12,700 --> 00:22:15,340
I had a bob like that once.

329
00:22:15,870 --> 00:22:16,870
Really?

330
00:22:17,010 --> 00:22:18,110
Yes.

331
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:21,580
The song "Short Hair"
was huge back then,

332
00:22:21,650 --> 00:22:23,910
so I jumped on the trend
and cut mine short like that.

333
00:22:25,750 --> 00:22:27,480
How have things been lately?

334
00:22:28,190 --> 00:22:31,390
With Director Joo joining
the scholarship program,

335
00:22:31,460 --> 00:22:33,890
the promotional video
seemed to turn out well.

336
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:37,330
Are Hae Ra and Director Joo
being helpful?

337
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:41,600
- Yes.
- Well, even if they are helpful,

338
00:22:41,670 --> 00:22:43,500
it must still feel uneasy at times.

339
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:46,870
How could it not?
I understand completely.

340
00:22:49,010 --> 00:22:53,080
If they ever make you uneasy,
feel free to talk to me.

341
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:56,110
If there's anything
I can smooth over,

342
00:22:56,110 --> 00:22:58,350
I'll step in and handle it myself.

343
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:01,490
Yes, I will.

344
00:23:02,590 --> 00:23:05,620
Being young sure is great.
You look fantastic.

345
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,020
Thank you.

346
00:23:11,190 --> 00:23:12,730
You punk.

347
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:14,770
(Kings of High School Basketball,
Fire Hawks)

348
00:23:16,130 --> 00:23:18,540
Hilarious, just hilarious.

349
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,440
Who...

350
00:23:26,340 --> 00:23:27,540
Could it be my daughter?

351
00:23:34,020 --> 00:23:36,720
Did you already hear from her?

352
00:23:37,020 --> 00:23:38,260
I told her...

353
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:41,690
that if she's curious,
she should ask her mom directly.

354
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:45,100
She went to see you, right?

355
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:47,860
I told you not to look
for my daughter.

356
00:23:51,170 --> 00:23:52,340
Just your daughter?

357
00:23:53,270 --> 00:23:54,600
An Hae Ra's ours,

358
00:23:55,940 --> 00:23:57,010
yours and mine.

359
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,550
You...

360
00:24:07,250 --> 00:24:09,890
Just how much did you tell her?

361
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:14,490
What did I tell her?
She'd already figured it out.

362
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:17,290
"Your mom is Joo Mi Ran,
I mean, Joo Ae Sook,"

363
00:24:17,730 --> 00:24:19,960
"and she planted you in that house."

364
00:24:21,630 --> 00:24:23,770
She's smart, just like me.

365
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:28,440
She already asked
who she was switched with.

366
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:32,110
So I told her,
why bother asking me...

367
00:24:32,110 --> 00:24:33,740
when she could go...

368
00:24:34,040 --> 00:24:37,110
straight to the person
who switched the babies?

369
00:24:39,150 --> 00:24:40,220
Switched?

370
00:24:40,380 --> 00:24:41,380
Am I wrong?

371
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:43,190
The Cheongma couple
had a kid of their own,

372
00:24:43,290 --> 00:24:45,360
which is how our Hae Ra
got into that family.

373
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:47,690
It seems Hae Ra grew up...

374
00:24:48,120 --> 00:24:51,330
without ever hearing anything
about being adopted.

375
00:24:56,930 --> 00:24:58,100
Ae Sook,

376
00:24:58,300 --> 00:25:01,570
why waste your energy trying to
pull cheap tricks that never work?

377
00:25:01,710 --> 00:25:02,910
It's simple.

378
00:25:03,040 --> 00:25:07,080
We're Hae Ra's biological parents,
nothing more.

379
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:12,080
Hae Ra will remain
Cheongma's daughter forever.

380
00:25:14,780 --> 00:25:15,920
What are you saying?

381
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,660
An Hae Ra will continue living...

382
00:25:18,660 --> 00:25:20,360
as Kang Hae Ra.

383
00:25:22,560 --> 00:25:25,400
And she'll become
the true owner of Cheongma.

384
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:29,370
That way, we can live without
worrying about money forever.

385
00:25:30,070 --> 00:25:33,040
I was told my luck would turn around
in my later years.

386
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:36,110
Guess they weren't
talking nonsense after all.

387
00:25:40,780 --> 00:25:41,780
Let's work together...

388
00:25:42,780 --> 00:25:45,480
to make Hae Ra
the true owner of Cheongma.

389
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:48,750
You already know Cheongma
inside and out.

390
00:25:49,050 --> 00:25:51,190
And if I do all the dirty work
behind the scenes,

391
00:25:51,550 --> 00:25:52,890
things will be easier for you.

392
00:25:54,460 --> 00:25:56,630
From the looks of it, Choi Jun Hwan
has probably outlived...

393
00:25:57,190 --> 00:25:59,100
his usefulness by now.

394
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:01,670
Do you think I'm crazy?

395
00:26:02,270 --> 00:26:03,830
Why would I ever get involved
with you again?

396
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:06,670
Think carefully.

397
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:09,510
Think about what choice
will actually benefit you.

398
00:26:10,740 --> 00:26:11,980
For your information,

399
00:26:12,580 --> 00:26:13,640
our daughter...

400
00:26:13,980 --> 00:26:15,680
decided to team up with me.

401
00:26:18,250 --> 00:26:19,850
Now, all that's left...

402
00:26:20,780 --> 00:26:21,920
is your decision, Ae Sook.

403
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:32,060
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

404
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,000
Let's work together...

405
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:38,670
to make Hae Ra
the true owner of Cheongma.

406
00:26:39,300 --> 00:26:42,140
Our daughter
decided to team up with me.

407
00:26:44,770 --> 00:26:46,180
Now, all that's left...

408
00:26:47,410 --> 00:26:48,580
is your decision, Ae Sook.

409
00:26:51,950 --> 00:26:52,980
An Guk Cheol...

410
00:26:54,580 --> 00:26:58,050
What on earth
are you planning to do?

411
00:27:08,500 --> 00:27:10,030
What the heck is this?

412
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:15,510
Has Ko Eun Seol lost her mind?

413
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:20,310
How many monthly installments
would you like?

414
00:27:21,380 --> 00:27:22,480
Pay in full, please.

415
00:27:23,410 --> 00:27:25,120
All right. Please wait a moment.

416
00:27:40,730 --> 00:27:43,700
There's no student registered
under the name Ko Eun Seol.

417
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:46,670
Are you telling me
she didn't enroll...

418
00:27:47,040 --> 00:27:49,310
for this semester at all?

419
00:27:50,010 --> 00:27:51,610
Yes, that is correct.

420
00:27:52,710 --> 00:27:53,710
I see.

421
00:27:57,080 --> 00:27:58,520
She didn't even register
for classes...

422
00:27:59,050 --> 00:28:01,420
and just bought
luxury goods instead?

423
00:28:03,120 --> 00:28:05,660
Ko Eun Seol, you little...

424
00:28:12,430 --> 00:28:15,330
Ms. Kang, what time
should we start today's meeting?

425
00:28:18,800 --> 00:28:21,170
Should we start right after lunch?

426
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:27,110
Excuse me, Ms. Kang.

427
00:28:27,110 --> 00:28:28,310
What is it?

428
00:28:28,310 --> 00:28:30,410
Why do you keep calling me?
It's distracting.

429
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:34,280
You said we'd have a meeting today
about this season's designs.

430
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:36,050
Isn't it fine
as long as we do it today?

431
00:28:36,120 --> 00:28:38,620
Why? Are you worried
you'll have to work late?

432
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,260
No, ma'am. That's not it.

433
00:28:43,830 --> 00:28:45,530
Start when Ko Eun Seol gets back.

434
00:28:46,630 --> 00:28:48,160
Lunch break isn't even over yet.

435
00:28:56,110 --> 00:28:58,810
What?
You want to kick Director Joo out?

436
00:28:59,510 --> 00:29:01,340
- Yes.
- So suddenly?

437
00:29:02,150 --> 00:29:04,810
Since you were young, you said
you couldn't live without her...

438
00:29:04,810 --> 00:29:07,020
and wouldn't let her leave.

439
00:29:07,820 --> 00:29:08,990
That was then.

440
00:29:10,420 --> 00:29:12,320
What brought this on?

441
00:29:14,420 --> 00:29:16,090
It's just uncomfortable.

442
00:29:16,730 --> 00:29:18,530
I see her at work all the time,

443
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,730
so do I really have to see her
at home too?

444
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:22,570
What is it?

445
00:29:22,630 --> 00:29:24,270
Did something unpleasant happen...

446
00:29:24,270 --> 00:29:26,140
while working on
the scholarship program?

447
00:29:26,940 --> 00:29:30,870
Yes. Working together,
we clashed on a lot of things.

448
00:29:31,610 --> 00:29:34,110
I don't need to stress myself out
at home, too.

449
00:29:35,180 --> 00:29:37,980
You must really be working hard...

450
00:29:38,210 --> 00:29:40,250
to get stressed over
something like that.

451
00:29:42,150 --> 00:29:46,620
Still, we can't kick her out
so suddenly.

452
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:49,930
Her opinion matters, and...

453
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:54,060
so does your father's.

454
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:58,900
Mom, can't you just push for this?

455
00:29:59,370 --> 00:30:02,240
Do you always need Dad's permission?
Can't you decide for yourself?

456
00:30:02,910 --> 00:30:04,640
You're the true owner...

457
00:30:05,340 --> 00:30:06,810
of both our house and this company.

458
00:30:09,810 --> 00:30:12,020
Just make up your mind quickly.

459
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:15,050
I can't stand seeing Director Joo
at home, too.

460
00:30:56,630 --> 00:30:59,660
(Head of Design Team, Kang Hae Ra)

461
00:31:04,630 --> 00:31:07,940
Sweetheart,
did you talk to your mom?

462
00:31:25,990 --> 00:31:28,360
I'll be waiting at the cafe
right outside the office.

463
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:39,200
Yes,

464
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:40,600
it's true.

465
00:31:46,680 --> 00:31:47,980
I'm the one...

466
00:31:49,380 --> 00:31:50,410
who gave birth to you.

467
00:32:24,210 --> 00:32:27,680
(A Trap Called Desire)

468
00:32:28,150 --> 00:32:29,190
I'm not leaving.

469
00:32:29,190 --> 00:32:31,390
I'll just stay and live here.

470
00:32:31,390 --> 00:32:32,960
Boss, should we get married?

471
00:32:33,120 --> 00:32:35,790
Seok Jin, your mom is missing.

472
00:32:36,130 --> 00:32:37,660
I'm marrying you no matter what.

473
00:32:37,730 --> 00:32:39,900
Aim high.
Work hard and make it happen.

474
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:42,600
Could this be...

475
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,670
Something feels more important
than language school right now.

476
00:32:45,700 --> 00:32:46,940
Like what?

477
00:32:47,100 --> 00:32:48,910
Stop looking for the girl
I was switched with.

478
00:32:48,970 --> 00:32:51,940
Who was she switched with?
Where does she live now?

479
00:32:52,040 --> 00:32:54,340
I need an insurance policy
of my own, too.

480
00:32:54,380 --> 00:32:55,980
What am I to you, Director Joo?

481
00:32:56,210 --> 00:32:58,780
You wanted to own Cheongma,
didn't you?

482
00:32:58,950 --> 00:33:00,550
That's why you used me.

483
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:03,090
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
